# Never copied into the image by `COPY . .`.
#
# node_modules/  the image installs its own for the right architecture
# data/          runtime state; compose mounts a named volume at /app/data,
#                and Docker SEEDS a fresh volume from image content -- so a
#                baked-in store.json becomes the deployed starting state
# .env           real secrets. v4-proxy's .env holds a live Anthropic key,
#                and an image is a distributable artifact
node_modules/
data/
logs/
.git/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
npm-debug.log
*.log
